# The both-directions evidence that backs a VERDICT tier and lives outside this repository's own
# test sources.
#
# TrustTier.VERDICT means a finding says the code is wrong, so promotion to it requires a case that
# fires on a bug and a case that stays silent on the correct twin. DetectorTrustCoverageTest
# resolves that evidence by reflection, which reaches only test methods in this module. The corpus
# eval holds pairs of exactly the same shape on unmodified third-party code, in a downstream module
# no test here can see: this file is how the two halves reach each other.
#
# Each line names a detector and its pair, as
#
#   DETECTOR_TYPE = fires-on-the-bug, stays-silent-on-the-twin
#
# and both sides check it. In this module, DetectorTrustCoverageTest requires every VERDICT row to
# be backed either by a pair of test methods it can resolve or by a line here, and requires every
# line here to name a detector actually classified VERDICT. In corpus-eval, CorpusGates requires
# each named id to be a RecordingSubject for that detector carrying that expectation, so a line
# that stops being true fails the corpus build rather than quietly vouching for a tier.
#
# The bar is the one the in-repo pairs meet: the two subjects differ in the defect and in nothing
# else. Two corpus-measured detectors are deliberately absent, and the reason is the detector's
# model rather than the pair (#406):
#
#   CACHE_CONCURRENCY asks the map's own type whether it synchronizes itself, so given one class
#   both halves of a pair get the same answer by construction and no same-class pair can exist. It
#   also consults no lock at all, so a HashMap correctly guarded by the caller's own lock draws the
#   same finding as a raced one. That is the definition of PROMPT.
#
#   CONCURRENT_MAP_CHECK_THEN_ACT is classified by its caller. recordCheckThenAct IS the assertion
#   that a check-then-act happened; the detector's own decision is only whether more than one
#   thread reached the same (map, key). A same-class pair exists and is in the corpus, and it makes
#   the silence a decision rather than an absence of calls, but it cannot make a finding mean the
#   code is wrong, because the body declared that before the detector saw anything.
#
# Blank lines and # comments are ignored.

SHARED_JSON_MAPPER_RECONFIG = recorded_objectMapper_reconfigureWhileWriting, recorded_objectMapper_configuredThenShared
SHARED_MESSAGE_DIGEST = recorded_messageDigest_sharedAcrossThreads, recorded_messageDigest_guardedByItsOwnMonitor
SHARED_STATEFUL_CRYPTO = recorded_mac_sharedAcrossThreads, recorded_mac_confinedToOneThreadEach
CONCURRENT_MAP_COMPUTE_RECURSION = recorded_caffeineAsMap_recursiveMerge, recorded_caffeineAsMap_selfContainedMerge
SYNCHRONIZED_COLLECTION_ITERATION = recorded_synchronizedCollection_iteratedWithoutLock, recorded_synchronizedCollection_iteratedHoldingLock
SHARED_ITERATOR = recorded_concurrentHashMultiset_sharedIterator, recorded_concurrentHashMultiset_iteratorPerThread
MUTABLE_MAP_KEY = recorded_mutableIntKey_mutatedAfterInsertion, recorded_mutableIntKey_neverMutated
JDBC_CONNECTION_SHARED = recorded_hoistedConnection_sharedAcrossThreads, recorded_hikariPool_checkoutPerThread
